  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "et001",
      "text": "一八八七年二月，巴黎一份報紙刊出一封抗議鐵塔的信。",
      "citations": [
        "R17",
        "R27",
        "R33"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et002",
      "text": "信上指名艾菲爾鐵塔，這時它甚至還沒站起來。",
      "citations": [
        "R38",
        "R164–167"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et003",
      "text": "艾菲爾自己說，工地的地基已下。",
      "citations": [
        "R141–143"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et004",
      "text": "寫信的藝術家，卻已罵它「無用又可怕」。",
      "citations": [
        "R52"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et005",
      "text": "他們還預想，巴黎將在塔影下過二十年。",
      "citations": [
        "R89"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et006",
      "text": "日子一到，這座塔真的就得拆嗎？",
      "citations": [
        "R89–92",
        "R133–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et007",
      "text": "一名記者就這場抗議問艾菲爾；他會怎麼回答？",
      "citations": [
        "R119"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et008",
      "text": "多年後，一座鐵塔電台被寫進報紙；它做成了什麼？",
      "citations": [
        "I1674–1678"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et009",
      "text": "這封信寫給阿爾方，請他替巴黎擋下工程。",
      "citations": [
        "R44",
        "R94–104"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea101",
      "text": "在他們筆下，阿爾方多次保護巴黎，這次也該替城市說話。",
      "citations": [
        "R94–100"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et010",
      "text": "署名者有作家、畫家、雕塑家和建築師。",
      "citations": [
        "R48"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et011",
      "text": "他們說，自己要保護的是巴黎的藝術和歷史。",
      "citations": [
        "R48–52"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et012",
      "text": "這封信先把巴黎描成什麼樣子？",
      "citations": [
        "R57–63"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et013",
      "text": "信裡的巴黎，有街道、河岸，還有古老的石造建築。",
      "citations": [
        "R57–63"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et014",
      "text": "在他們眼中，鐵製高塔一建成，這幅畫就會走樣。",
      "citations": [
        "R48–53",
        "R83–92"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea102",
      "text": "他們還怪市府迎合「造機器的人」的商業想像，任巴黎受損。",
      "citations": [
        "R67–73"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et015",
      "text": "抗議者寫道，人們早把它叫作「巴別塔」。",
      "citations": [
        "R52–55"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et016",
      "text": "比起名字，他們更怕高塔會壓住哪些建築？",
      "citations": [
        "R83–92"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et017",
      "text": "一根巨大的黑色工廠煙囪，壓在巴黎上空。",
      "citations": [
        "R83–85"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et018",
      "text": "聖母院、羅浮宮和凱旋門，都被寫進陰影裡。",
      "citations": [
        "R83–88"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et019",
      "text": "信說，它們會被高塔襯得矮小，甚至像消失了。",
      "citations": [
        "R83–89"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et020",
      "text": "外國遊客還沒來，抗議者就想像他們嘲笑法國品味。",
      "citations": [
        "R75–80"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et021",
      "text": "這些可怕畫面，是已經量過的結果嗎？",
      "citations": [
        "R57–80"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et022",
      "text": "這是請願書描繪出的未來景象，不是實測的塔影。",
      "citations": [
        "R83–92",
        "R164–167"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et023",
      "text": "還記得開頭的二十年嗎？信怕這景象延續那麼久。",
      "citations": [
        "R89–92"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et024",
      "text": "除了塔影，他們最後還要留下什麼？",
      "citations": [
        "R94–104"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et025",
      "text": "信的末尾，連建築師加尼耶都列在署名中。",
      "citations": [
        "R106–112"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et026",
      "text": "他們說，即使警告落空，仍要讓抗議留在紙上。",
      "citations": [
        "R101–104"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et027",
      "text": "面對這封抗議信，艾菲爾先回應了什麼？",
      "citations": [
        "R119–123"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et028",
      "text": "開頭那名記者來自《時報》，他問艾菲爾對抗議的看法。",
      "citations": [
        "R119–123"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et029",
      "text": "艾菲爾先對加尼耶的署名感到驚訝。",
      "citations": [
        "R123–127"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et030",
      "text": "他說，建築師加尼耶也在塔的委員會，會裡做過的事都曾得到他的同意。",
      "citations": [
        "R123–127"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea113",
      "text": "那他認為，抗議到底晚在哪一步？",
      "citations": [
        "R129–132"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et031",
      "text": "艾菲爾說，若早一年反對，還能參與討論。",
      "citations": [
        "R129–132"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et032",
      "text": "如今契約已簽，鐵料也訂好了。",
      "citations": [
        "R132–143"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et033",
      "text": "照他的說法，叫停眼前工程的時機已過。",
      "citations": [
        "R140–145"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et034",
      "text": "他甚至擔心，抗議會嚇走世博的參觀者。",
      "citations": [
        "R147–150"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et035",
      "text": "他相信高塔本身能吸引遊客；那只是他的預想。",
      "citations": [
        "R147–150"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et036",
      "text": "但他談到契約時，問題忽然變得具體。",
      "citations": [
        "R132–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et037",
      "text": "他說建塔要花多少錢，國家又補助多少？",
      "citations": [
        "R133–136"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et038",
      "text": "艾菲爾說，建塔估計要五百萬到六百萬法郎。",
      "citations": [
        "R133–135"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et039",
      "text": "國家先出一百五十萬法郎作補助。",
      "citations": [
        "R134–136"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et040",
      "text": "除了這筆錢，他還拿到哪一項權利？",
      "citations": [
        "R134–136"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et041",
      "text": "世博舉辦期間，由他經營這座塔。",
      "citations": [
        "R135–136"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et042",
      "text": "他又說，展覽結束後，國家會把塔交給巴黎市。",
      "citations": [
        "R136–138"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et043",
      "text": "接著，巴黎市給他二十年的經營權。",
      "citations": [
        "R137–138"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et044",
      "text": "這段權利走完，鐵塔又歸誰決定？",
      "citations": [
        "R138–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et045",
      "text": "艾菲爾稱這段經營權，是市府給他的第二筆補助。",
      "citations": [
        "R136–138"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et046",
      "text": "他說，期滿後塔歸巴黎市，由市府處置。",
      "citations": [
        "R138–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et047",
      "text": "按他的說法，期限只寫到他的經營權。",
      "citations": [
        "R137–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et048",
      "text": "可報紙轉述的受訪說法，能代替契約原文嗎？",
      "citations": [
        "R119–123"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et049",
      "text": "不能。這裡沒有一句說，期滿市府就必須拆塔。",
      "citations": [
        "R133–140"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et050",
      "text": "記者卻沒有把話題停在眼前的工地。",
      "citations": [
        "R153–155"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
