      "text": "他追問的，是塔建成之後的哪件事？",
      "citations": [
        "R129–145",
        "R153–155"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et052",
      "text": "他提醒艾菲爾：藝術家反對的是世博後仍留塔。",
      "citations": [
        "R153–155"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et053",
      "text": "這回，艾菲爾又會怎麼回答？",
      "citations": [
        "R153–157"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et054",
      "text": "艾菲爾說，若問將來留不留，現在反而太早。",
      "citations": [
        "R157–160"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et055",
      "text": "還記得開場那座尚未站起來的塔嗎？艾菲爾說，誰也沒看過實物。",
      "citations": [
        "R164–167"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et056",
      "text": "人們手上只有流傳的幾何圖。",
      "citations": [
        "R164–169"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et057",
      "text": "只看圖，能判它一定難看嗎？他反問。",
      "citations": [
        "R164–169"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea104",
      "text": "他甚至假設，塔建成後若很美，反對留塔的人或許會後悔太早出手。",
      "citations": [
        "R171–175"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et058",
      "text": "他開始回應那根被形容成煙囪的鐵塔。",
      "citations": [
        "R83–92",
        "R177–190"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea105",
      "text": "他反問：工程師只管堅固，難道不管優雅嗎？",
      "citations": [
        "R177–183"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et059",
      "text": "他說，塔身四條邊線的曲線，來自抗風計算。",
      "citations": [
        "R184–190"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et060",
      "text": "計算出的線條，也可能成為美感的一部分。",
      "citations": [
        "R184–190"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea106",
      "text": "艾菲爾還說，巨大的尺度本身也能讓人驚嘆。",
      "citations": [
        "R192–203"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et061",
      "text": "這是建造者的主張，藝術家還有另一個擔心。",
      "citations": [
        "R177–190",
        "R206–226"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et062",
      "text": "那座高塔，會不會把巴黎名勝壓得矮小？",
      "citations": [
        "R83–88",
        "R206–212"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et063",
      "text": "艾菲爾拿聖母院前的廣場，作了一個反問。",
      "citations": [
        "R206–212"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et064",
      "text": "站在聖母院前，真能看見鐵塔嗎？",
      "citations": [
        "R209–212"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et065",
      "text": "他說看不見，所以不妨礙人在廣場欣賞聖母院。",
      "citations": [
        "R209–212"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea107",
      "text": "他又拿凱旋門說明：那座拱門很高，旁邊房子也不會像被壓扁。",
      "citations": [
        "R213–220"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et066",
      "text": "兩邊都在爭論一座尚未建成的塔會如何被看見。",
