        "R222–226"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "ea108",
      "text": "艾菲爾坦白說，當眼前工程顯出真實規模，連他本人也吃了一驚。",
      "citations": [
        "R222–225"
      ],
      "script_video_claims_aligned": true,
      "source_review": "PASS"
    },
    {
      "id": "et067",
      "text": "可是信上還有一個更難回的指控：「無用」。",
